{"ts":"2026-07-24T21:01:24.761Z","author":"codex-root","op":"create","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/body","value":"## Scope\\n\\nDeliver one production-ready API and release reliability bundle: typed compact registry discovery with optional semantic decoding and filters, complete docs/help/schema/live acceptance, latest managed pm-changelog, and clean-runner publication verification parity. Raw live inventories and credentials remain external and redacted."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"hac-r17v"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"Add token-efficient registry discovery and release-runner parity"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"Expose the official compact entity-registry display contract for agent workflows, preserve full typed and passthrough access, update the managed changelog package, and make tag-driven publication provision the same mandatory verifier toolchain as automatic release preparation."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Feature"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":0},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["agents","api","entity-registry","github-actions","home-assistant","pm-changelog","release","websocket"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-07-24T21:01:24.761Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-24T21:01:24.761Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/deadline","value":"2026-07-26T21:01:24.761Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/assignee","value":"codex-root"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"codex-root"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":420},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"hassio registries exposes the official compact display endpoint with token-efficient and decoded output, filtering, count, and limit behavior; Full source coverage remains 100/100/100/100, docstrings remain complete, every command help path and every formatter remains valid, and live read-only E2E passes; Tag-driven publish installs every tool required by release:verify, latest pm-changelog generates the canonical changelog, and hosted rehearsal succeeds without publishing a new version"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/definition_of_ready","value":"All-status PM lineage, official docs, live endpoint shape, exact failed release logs, current code, and managed package versions reviewed without recording private values"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/goal","value":"complete-agent-home-assistant-interface"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/objective","value":"compact-discovery-and-reliable-publication"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/value","value":"Reduce agent token and bandwidth cost while restoring trustworthy automated release verification."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/impact","value":"Agents can query enabled registry metadata efficiently and maintainers can trust the same mandatory gates in preparation and publication."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/outcome","value":"A reviewed and merged typed discovery surface with reproducible clean-runner release parity."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/why_now","value":"The official compact endpoint is live but untyped in the CLI, and the latest production tag failed before publication because the publish runner omitted mandatory tools."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"hac-4s9j"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/reviewer","value":"unbraind"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":96},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/sprint","value":"2026-07-compact-registry"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/release","value":"2026.7.24"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"hac-n0ix","kind":"discovered_from","created_at":"2026-07-24T21:01:24.761Z","author":"codex-root"},{"id":"hac-suj3","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-24T21:01:24.761Z","author":"codex-root"},{"id":"hac-wwsi","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-24T21:01:24.761Z","author":"codex-root"}]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-07-24T21:01:24.761Z","author":"codex-root","text":"Duplicate audit found no existing compact list_for_display item; the open GitHub release blocker is the production manifestation of a distinct publish-runner tool provisioning gap."}]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/notes","value":[{"created_at":"2026-07-24T21:01:24.761Z","author":"codex-root","text":"Privacy boundary: keep token, credentials, raw live registry rows, user identifiers, signed paths, and instance inventory out of PM, git, logs, and GitHub."}]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/learnings","value":[{"created_at":"2026-07-24T21:01:24.761Z","author":"codex-root","text":"Official Home Assistant docs now designate config/entity_registry/list_for_display as the bandwidth-efficient enabled-entity contract; the live server returns compact documented field keys."}]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/files","value":[{"path":"src/api/registries.ts","scope":"project","note":"Typed compact registry transport"},{"path":".github/workflows/publish.yml","scope":"project","note":"Tag publication verifier provisioning"}]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tests","value":[{"command":"bun run release:verify","scope":"project","timeout_seconds":2400,"note":"Aggregate production gate"}]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/docs","value":[{"path":"docs/API.md","scope":"project","note":"Registry API contract"},{"path":"docs/RELEASING.md","scope":"project","note":"Publication runner contract"}]}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"955e48ace0da23c1ea502dffea4f1246e12215b1c9d93cfd8442ebd48a7d0b01","message":"Create compact registry and release reliability feature"}
